      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SILENT DIVA (5) is hard to knock on his recent form, winning three of her last four, including a 0.6L victory last time out at Belmont. Draws better this time and CJP hops back on board today. Can lob into a midfield position and let rip again to bring up the hat-trick. ARCADIA KNIGHT (3) won impressively fresh before getting a long way back over this trip at Belmont last time out. Now third-up, he can sit closer than he did last time out and Tsang's claim comes in handy. Expecting a much better performance third-up. EXCELTRAIN (6) has been racing well without winning over 1400m recently, missing by 1.7L after sitting handy throughout at Kalgoorlie last time out. He should find the front once again and if he can stretch to the mile now, he'll be hard to hold out. OLY'S CHOICE (2)  just missed last start when closing nicely at Belmont and now third-up, he can land the knockout blow. SILVER EYE (1) might be looking for this trip now and a much better effort is on the cards.",
